etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小米发布并开源MiMo-V2.6系列模型，以46分登顶最强开源模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为云CodeArts全面升级，发布全球首个鸿蒙专属AI编码智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI成立数学与AI顾问组，神秘模型24天攻破百余项世界级数学难题</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里平头哥发布AI芯片真武V900，算力较M890提升至三倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c7d9edadc63c9abf5e536b8b6cc12fd1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在2026云栖大会上，阿里平头哥正式发布新一代AI芯片真武V900，其算力性能达到上一代真武M890的三倍。该芯片支持构建单一集群扩展至50万卡，旨在为前沿AI模型训练与推理提供大规模算力支撑。阿里集团CEO吴泳铭表示，自研M890 AI超节点已具备支撑2万亿参数大模型推理的能力，并于本季度在阿里云数据中心实现规模化上架。此外，阿里同步布局端侧AI生态，正式开源千问2.7B模型并推出移动端AI解决方案。通过从真武V900芯片、超大规模集群到云端基础设施及端侧模型的全栈布局，阿里正构建覆盖模型训练、推理及终端部署的完整算力体系，以满足不同场景下的AI算力需求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布混元图像3.5预览版：支持多图融合与2K输出，API调用仅需0.15元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/943dfcd819a66e4ad7d52ee93bf22803.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正式发布混元图像3.5（Hy Image3.5 preview）预览版，在画质、排版及修图能力上较上一代提升约30%。该模型核心升级在于画字精准度与布局理解力，并支持最多5张参考图同时输入进行风格融合，最高支持2K分辨率输出。在成本控制方面，通过腾讯云API调用生成一张2K图片仅需0.15元，且实行废图不计费策略。内部盲测显示，该模型表现与Seedream 5.0 pro持平，优于多款同类竞品。目前，Hy Image3.5 preview已在元宝、ima等腾讯系产品上线，开发者可通过腾讯云API直接调用。灰度测试数据显示，用户画图需求量增长超50%，在影视分镜绘制、海报设计等场景中显著提升了批量出图效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米发布并开源MiMo-V2.6系列模型，以46分登顶最强开源模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4670fd772851c0777dab435803f6b12e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米于9月22日正式发布并开源MiMo-V2.6系列模型，包含MiMo-V2.6-Pro与MiMo-V2.6-Flash两款原生全模态模型，权重及技术报告已上线HuggingFace。该系列采用RSI（递归自我改进）路径，在不到6天的Live RL训练中，通过更大Batch（1568样本、1M上下文）及冻结MoE Router等技术，显著提升了任务通过率。在Artificial Analysis智能指数中，MiMo-V2.6-Pro以46分位居开源模型榜首，性能在Design Arena评测中已接近Claude Opus5与GPT-5.6Sol。该模型具备3D游戏生成、具身机械臂控制及复杂科研任务处理能力，并在Lean4中完成了Li–Yorke混沌定理的形式化。小米同步上线MiMo Desktop客户端与开放平</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为云CodeArts全面升级，发布全球首个鸿蒙专属AI编码智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8be91497157abcc04a7d5da3ff0d153e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">华为云CodeArts正式上线鸿蒙编码大模型、码道鸿蒙智能体及鸿蒙开发者实践中心，打造全球首个专为鸿蒙生态设计的AI编码智能体。核心组件鸿蒙编码大模型依托鸿蒙增强训练体系，在代码生成质量、编译通过率及Token消耗效率上实现优化。配套的鸿蒙编码智能体集成DevEco CLI等首创能力，覆盖从编码、调试到构建的全流程，实现开发环节的自动化衔接。此外，鸿蒙开发者实践中心提供云端实战环境与多场景案例，旨在降低新手开发门槛。此次升级旨在打通鸿蒙应用从创意构思到最终上架的全生命周期，通过AI辅助显著提升开发效率，解决鸿蒙生态开发者在复杂开发流程中的痛点，推动鸿蒙原生应用的高效产出。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI成立数学与AI顾问组，神秘模型24天攻破百余项世界级数学难题</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f39d013c609928964b3655cf21265248.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于9月22日宣布成立“数学与AI顾问组”，并披露其8月28日启动训练的神秘模型在24天内攻克了100多个数学领域开放问题，包括纳维-斯托克斯千年大奖难题。该顾问组设在普林斯顿高等研究院，由9位顶尖数学家组成，其中包括Timothy Gowers、Martin Hairer和Edward Witten三位菲尔兹奖得主。该组织独立于OpenAI运作，成员不领取报酬，旨在就AI数学成果的评审、传播及学术标准提供建议。OpenAI表示，该模型在数学领域的突破速度令内部专家感到惊讶，公司正审慎评估如何部署相关数学能力。此举旨在回应学界对AI解决数学难题可能带来的负面影响及学术伦理的担忧，加强与数学界的沟通与协作，确保AI在基础科学领域的开发与应用符合学术规范。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
